:53620,"endMs":54840},{"text":"Our governing question is: who may publish when two","startMs":54840,"endMs":58940},{"text":"workers touch the same resource?","startMs":58940,"endMs":61480},{"text":"We will compare topologies, classify conflicts, derive a fencing","startMs":61480,"endMs":65000},{"text":"protocol, and test event and handoff recovery.","startMs":65000,"endMs":68580},{"text":"By the end, you should be able to locate","startMs":68580,"endMs":70560},{"text":"the actual enforcement point and explain how useful historical","startMs":70560,"endMs":74260},{"text":"work survives without restoring stale authority.","startMs":74260,"endMs":77280}],"boardEvents":[{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":0},{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":1},{"atMs":21380,"actionIndex":2},{"atMs":35600,"actionIndex":3},{"atMs":46860,"actionIndex":4},{"atMs":54840,"actionIndex":5}],"boardTimingMethod":"authored-spoken-cues-v1"}